# 📊 Logcat Error Frequency Analysis  
**Comparison: 2025-12-03 (Before Security Patch) vs 2025-12-13 (After Security Patch)**

> Scope: Boot-time `logcat *:E`  
> Note: Timestamp differences do not affect analysis

---

## 🔹 2025-12-03 (Before Security Patch)

### Top Error Tags (Sorted by Frequency)

| Rank | Tag | Count | Category |
|---|---|---:|---|
| 1 | `audio_route` | 177 | Audio HAL / Routing |
| 2 | `APM_AudioPolicyManager` | 156 | Audio Framework |
| 3 | `Diag_Lib` | 151 | Qualcomm Diagnostic |
| 4 | `FirebaseInstanceId` | 140 | Google Service |
| 5 | `SystemServiceRegistry` | 135 | Android Framework |
| 6 | `Finsky` | 72 | Google Play Store |
| 7 | `system_server` | 69 | Core Framework |
| 8 | `BATTERY_CHG` | 65 | Battery HAL |
| 9 | `HealthConnectResContext` | 61 | Google Health |
| 10 | `ServiceManager` | 57 | Binder / Service |

**Characteristics**
- Errors mainly from HAL / framework initialization
- No dominant retry loop
- Typical boot-time noise

---

## 🔹 2025-12-13 (After Security Patch)

### Top Error Tags (Sorted by Frequency)

| Rank | Tag | Count | Category | Delta vs 12-03 |
|---|---|---:|---|---|
| 1 | `MendelPackageState` | 968 | Google / Package State | New (Massive) |
| 2 | `Phlogger` | 182 | App / Logging | New |
| 3 | `RegistryDataStore` | 180 | Encrypted Registry | New |
| 4 | `audio_route` | 177 | Audio HAL | ≈ Same |
| 5 | `APM_AudioPolicyManager` | 156 | Audio Framework | ≈ Same |
| 6 | `Diag_Lib` | 151 | Qualcomm Diagnostic | ≈ Same |
| 7 | `SystemServiceRegistry` | 121 | Framework | Slight ↓ |
| 8 | `YouTubeMusic` | 84 | Google App | ↑ |
| 9 | `BATTERY_CHG` | 76 | Battery HAL | ↑ |
| 10 | `HealthConnectResContext` | 61 | Google Health | ≈ Same |

---

## 🔥 Key Findings

- Error increase is **not system-wide regression**
- Major contributors:
  - `MendelPackageState` (package snapshot / schema retry)
  - `RegistryDataStore` (encryption / BAD_DECRYPT)
  - `Phlogger` (app init stack traces)

---

## 🧠 Engineering Conclusion

- No kernel / HAL / audio / sensor regression detected
- Increase localized to Google services & encrypted data handling
- Consistent with post–security patch data compatibility behavior

---

