Optional verification:
```bash
adb shell pm clear com.google.android.gms
adb shell pm clear com.android.vending
```

Noise-reduced KPI (exclude tags):
```
MendelPackageState
RegistryDataStore
Phlogger
```

---

**Summary**

After applying the security patch, the increase in boot-time logcat errors is primarily caused by Google service data and encrypted registry retry behavior, not by core system instability.
